        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, «Xoorór Israeli ka beer, ‹Kuungaá kilá' aga axasé' aníng niwa dirhúng i axweés iimír gawaá doorí wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsi'iidaá munguaá hatlá' awa taa tleéhh ar peésa nee sahaábuwo mi koomara' dinkwa nee aníng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' kitángw aníng iwa ilahhooárí hanmisa' tleehhaak ar hhape, as hikwaahúng nee bee/angwhúng kiwa gawaadií tsu/a' tawa ilahhooár da/a/aangw nee ilahhooár wayda. Umuúqo dír án muu nguwa inslawtisár wa sla'a umueene, aníng nun i hardáh kuungá', nuri tsuúq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxés kitángw ilahhooa u tléhh ar tlaa/e, mu tleehhaar ar tlaa/aá taa tsiíhh, asma xooslmoodá' ta tlaa/ár tsihhi kitangwduú ilahhooa gu meetagaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám kitángw ilahhooar'eé' mu tsa/a/amtoórí tleehhara', as heé amoodá' i tsa/a/ám /aankwetsuuwós mukuwa ár.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.26"
            ]
          }
